Third-party components
----------------------

The adapter weights (distributed separately at `HenryZ838978/fugue-scion-v4`)
are derived from MiniMax-Music3 outputs and are subject to the MiniMax-Music3
license terms. YuE2-3B, YuE2-Vae, SheetSage2 and MERT-v2-FullSong are copyright
their authors (M-A-P) and are used unmodified under their respective licenses.

The sample audio contains covers of existing recordings. The underlying musical
works remain the property of their rights holders; the samples are published as
a research demonstration and the license above covers only this project's own
contribution to them.
